    "open_assumptions": [
      "A repeated purchase id with the same player and item returns ok:true, replayed:true and the original PurchaseRecord (rather than ok:false 'duplicate'), so the caller must check replayed before delivering a rumor. The same id reused with a different player or item is rejected as 'duplicate'.",
      "The request-id lookup runs before the stale-tick check, so a retry always finds its original purchase.",
